{"title":"Classic Billboard","slug":"Classic_Billboard","hero":{"file":"Classic_Billboard.webp","width":368,"height":389},"pageid":899,"revid":16993,"timestamp":"2025-01-22T09:18:40Z","lastEditor":"Fireknight4802","categories":["Structures"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Classic Biome {{!}} Ferwater"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Classic Store"},{"label":"Price","value":"$1,270"},{"label":"Function","value":"When unboxed it can be placed in the claim and changes after some seconds to another image"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.13.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"28/06/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The Classic Billboard when bought is in a box and when unboxed it can be placed like any other structure in the claim and when placed it randomly select one image after 10-15 seconds.\n</p><p>The description says: Wowzers! A brand new happy home for happy people? For only 50tix!?\n</p><p>The Classic Billboard costs $1,270 at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Classic_Store/\">Classic Store</a>.\n</p><p>There are 14 or more pictures. Here are a few of them.<br>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: One photo what could appear in the Billboard\">One photo what could appear in the Billboard</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The Magickal Witch Shoppe\">The Magickal Witch Shoppe</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Get Help\">Get Help</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BloxMart\">BloxMart</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BoatAd\">BoatAd</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: CrowbarAd\">CrowbarAd</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: FlybugRepel\">FlybugRepel</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: MansionAd\">MansionAd</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: NukesforKids\">NukesforKids</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: QualityHomes\">QualityHomes</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RobloxianWireless\">RobloxianWireless</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RobloxNews\">RobloxNews</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: StudioAre\">StudioAre</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: SupportRiseOfIZA\">SupportRiseOfIZA</span></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: TheGodbuilder\">TheGodbuilder</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of many Structures that can't be Stacked. (No Increase/Decrease Content Button) The others are <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Valentines_Balloons/\">Valentines Balloons</a> (due to the fact that they were sold before Stacking was a thing) and Halloween Balloons.</li></ul>"}
